---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1)
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="solution-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge badge-green">La Solución Integral</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Dos productos. <span class="gradient-text-green">Un solo recorrido continuo.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Earlify Health soluciona la desconexión uniendo ambos mundos: la evaluación clínica de alta precisión y la continuidad terapéutica diaria en el hogar. No vendemos software aislado, ofrecemos un ecosistema.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="solution-bridge">
      
      <!-- Lado Clínico -->
      <div class="solution-card glass-card via-card">
        <div class="solution-logo-container">
          <div class="logo-icon">🩺</div>
          <h3>VIA+</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="solution-role">Apoyo a la Decisión Clínica</p>
        <p class="solution-text">
          Software como Dispositivo Médico (SaMD) diseñado para el entorno clínico. Estandariza la evaluación de audición y lenguaje, apoyando al profesional en la toma de decisiones con datos objetivos.
        </p>
        <ul class="solution-features">
          <li>Evaluación gamificada de alta precisión</li>
          <li>Apoyo diagnóstico (CDSS)</li>
          <li>Reducción del "Ruido Clínico"</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- El Puente -->
      <div class="bridge-connection">
        <div class="bridge-line"></div>
        <div class="bridge-badge glass-card">
          <span>Sincronización</span>
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="16 16 12 20 8 16"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="20"></line>
            <polyline points="8 8 12 4 16 8"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="4" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Lado Hogar -->
      <div class="solution-card glass-card valeria-card">
        <div class="solution-logo-container">
          <div class="logo-icon">🏠</div>
          <h3>Valeria+</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="solution-role">Rehabilitación en el Hogar</p>
        <p class="solution-text">
          Aplicación móvil terapéutica para familias. Traslada el plan clínico al día a día mediante objetivos claros y actividades guiadas para potenciar el desarrollo auditivo-verbal.
        </p>
        <ul class="solution-features">
          <li>Rutinas diarias y cápsulas formativas</li>
          <li>Seguimiento de progreso para los padres</li>
          <li>Aumenta la adherencia terapéutica</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .solution-section { 
    position: relative;
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.03), transparent 50%);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .badge-green {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    color: #10b981;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .gradient-text-green {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #34d399 0%, #10b981 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .section-description {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .solution-bridge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .solution-card {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 500px;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .solution-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  .via-card {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
  }
  .via-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.5);
  }

  .valeria-card {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
  }
  .valeria-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
  }

  .solution-logo-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .logo-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
  }

  .solution-card h3 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .solution-role {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .via-card .solution-role { color: var(--accent-cyan); }
  .valeria-card .solution-role { color: var(--accent-purple); }

  .solution-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .solution-features {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .solution-features li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .via-card .solution-features li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .valeria-card .solution-features li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .bridge-connection {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    width: 60px;
  }

  .bridge-line {
    width: 2px;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-cyan) 0%, var(--accent-purple) 100%);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .bridge-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .bridge-badge span {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .bridge-badge svg {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .solution-bridge {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .bridge-connection {
      width: 100%;
      height: 60px;
      flex-direction: row;
    }
    .bridge-line {
      width: 100%;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-cyan) 0%, var(--accent-purple) 100%);
    }
    .bridge-badge {
      flex-direction: row;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
